      "gh:supportingCharacters": ["character:Takeru", "character:Kaname"],
      "gh:realCase": "SNS Investment Scam / Celebrity Impersonation (2024)",
      "gh:sinContrast": "Vainglory (虚飾の正義) vs. Truth (静かなる真実)",
      "gh:nistFocus": ["ID.RA (Risk Assessment)", "PR.AA (Identity Management)", "RS.MA (Mitigation)"],
      "gh:description": "SNS型投資詐欺。Renの逆探知、Takeruの資金経路解析、Kanameの法的凍結が結集し、HEROの虚飾を剥ぎ取る。"
